1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:04,640
Mmm…

2
00:00:05,359 --> 00:00:06,919
- Mmm.
- You okay?

3
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:10,640
Go lie down first. Go.

4
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:22,229
Then just sleep first. I'll go buy some water.

5
00:00:22,229 --> 00:00:24,406
Hey, I'm coming too.

6
00:00:27,225 --> 00:00:29,394
You're drunk—can you even walk?

7
00:00:29,394 --> 00:00:31,547
Huh? No, I can— I can walk.

8
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:36,955
I'm strong. I'll carry the whole pack.

9
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:45,158
Go, go, go—wasting time.
Let's go buy water.

10
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:53,312
Put it here… yeah.

11
00:00:56,840 --> 00:01:04,239
Oh— I think I left my car keys in your room, Earth.
Go get them.

12
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:11,556
Here they are.
Pretty, right?

13
00:01:14,716 --> 00:01:18,355
Okay… then I'm going now.
Yeah, really going.

14
00:01:19,888 --> 00:01:22,185
Go then.
Okay, I'm leaving. See you.

15
00:01:23,625 --> 00:01:24,286
That way.

16
00:01:24,286 --> 00:01:26,636
- Oh—
- Not that way.

17
00:01:27,612 --> 00:01:30,000
Uh… I'm going.

18
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:32,640
I'm going now.
